  "method": [
    "Read original manufacturer bulletins downloaded from NHTSA, retaining original URL, SHA-256 and physical PDF page boundaries. Catalog summaries were used only for discovery; actual document scope governs the articles.",
    "Individually authored English articles with specific diagnostic branches, firmware conditions, component inspection findings and verification boundaries. No title-to-generic-prose generator was used.",
    "All 100 proposed final manuscripts have parseable metadata and bounded source-page references. All remain drafts; source checked is not human mechanic approval.",
    "Visually checked scanned C0529 and P2AF5 pages, Kia P2562 voltage/adaptation table, both Mercedes P0944 pages, P0248 applicability table and P26FB vacuum-orifice page.",
    "No inferred universal make or model coverage from NHTSA tags. No invented repair prices, pinouts, diagnostic measurements or present warranty entitlement. High-voltage, brake, airbag and fuel work is bounded to qualified service procedures.",
    "Source files and extracted text remain in scratch; repository manuscripts contain original explanations and direct source links."
  ],
