    {
      "code": "P04EE",
      "issue": "The written March 15, 2023 production cutoff conflicts with the printed MDH 0523XX. The article does not assume which is correct."
    },
    {
      "code": "P083F",
      "issue": "The diagnosis section permits symptomatic vehicles outside the VIN list, then states VIN-only applicability. The article conservatively requires dealer clarification."
    },
    {
      "code": "P0C73",
      "issue": "The introductory contamination note is broader than the illustrated simple-versus-severe branch on physical page 4. Current Kia guidance is needed for repair classification. NHTSA EV catalog tags are excluded by the OEM HEV/PHEV scope."
